        </h1>
        <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78); font-size: 1.05rem; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.6;">
            How an accidental late-night game of Tic-Tac-Toe while testing WebSocket latency revealed that an infinite canvas isn't just for work—it's a shared place to hang out.
        </p>

